ish Explanation\">\nAssume tension between block A and B is T<sub>1</sub> and block B and C is T<sub>2</sub>. Acceleration a = 0.6 m/s<sup>2</sup>.\n<br><br><b>For block A :</b>\n<br><br>F - T<sub>1</sub> = ma\n<br><br><b>For block B :</b>\n<br><br>T<sub>1</sub> - T<sub>2</sub> = ma\n<br><br>By adding both those equation we get,\n<br><br>F - T<sub>2</sub> = 2ma\n<br><br>T<sub>2</sub> = F - 2ma\n<br><br>T<sub>2</sub> = 10.2 - 2<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>2<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>0.6 = 10.2 - 2.4 = 7.8 N"}]}